You may copy, share and adapt the data, including commercially, as long as you
credit "Nemischa (https://github.com/TemurTurayev/nemischa)" and release your
adapted data under the same license.

Noun genders and plural forms were checked against Wiktionary
(https://de.wiktionary.org, CC BY-SA 3.0) through the german-nouns package
(https://github.com/gambolputty/german-nouns); a small number of plural forms
were taken from it.
